---
import Layout from "../../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Year in Review 2025 – CENIT e.V."
  canonical="https://cenit-ev.de/en/einblicke-entwicklungen/jahresrueckblick-2025/"
  description="CENIT e.V.'s year in review 2025 – founding, mission statement, and the first steps in building the association."
  bodyClass="page-einblicke"
>
  <section class="cenit-section">
    <div class="cenit-container">
      <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--muted-foreground); margin-bottom:28px;">
        <a href="/en/einblicke-entwicklungen/" style="color:var(--muted-foreground); text-decoration:none;">← Insights &amp; Developments</a>
      </p>
      <div class="cenit-card cenit-einblicke-panel reveal" style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
        <p style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--cenit-purple); margin:0 0 10px 0; font-weight:600;">
          Annual Review · 2025
        </p>
        <h1 class="cenit-h2 cenit-einblicke-title">Year in Review 2025</h1>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-subtitle"><strong>CENIT — building foundations, setting direction, and first impact</strong></p>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">Dear members, friends, sponsors, and supporters of CENIT,</p>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">
          2025 marked a pivotal year of founding and capacity building for CENIT. During this year, we established the organizational,
          strategic, and communications foundations that our future work will build on.
        </p>

        <h2 class="cenit-h3 cenit-einblicke-h">Founding and formal foundations</h2>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">
          Over the course of 2025, CENIT was formally founded. A key milestone was achieved with the recognition of our non-profit status.
          This confirms our commitment to act sustainably, independently, and in the public interest.
        </p>

        <h2 class="cenit-h3 cenit-einblicke-h">Mission statement and strategic direction</h2>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">
          Another central step was adopting our mission statement. It sets out our shared ambition:
        </p>
        <div class="cenit-softcard cenit-einblicke-quote">
          <p class="cenit-text-body" style="margin:0;">
            We are committed to making prevention in dance a natural part of health culture – across institutions, generations, and social contexts.
          </p>
          <p class="cenit-text-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;">
            Our mission is to make the scientific foundations of dance prevention visible, to enable research, and to curate and disseminate evidence-based knowledge
            – so that structures emerge which enable healthy dancing for everyone.
          </p>
          <p class="cenit-text-body" style="margin:12px 0 0; opacity:.8;">– From the CENIT e.V. mission statement</p>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;">
            <a class="cenit-btn cenit-btn--light" href="/en/satzung#leitbild">Mission statement</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">This mission statement serves as our guiding framework for all future activities and decisions.</p>

        <h2 class="cenit-h3 cenit-einblicke-h">Building our communications</h2>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">2025 was also defined by the systematic build-up of our communications work.</p>
        <ul class="cenit-einblicke-list">
          <li>We designed and launched a bilingual website (German/English) to ensure CENIT is internationally accessible from the outset.</li>
          <li>In parallel, we built a LinkedIn company presence as a key channel for communication and dialogue.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="cenit-h3 cenit-einblicke-h">Networking and first connections</h2>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">
          A key focus was establishing initial connections with established stakeholders in the dance ecosystem.
          These conversations provide the basis for future cooperation and help us better understand needs, interfaces, and shared perspectives.
        </p>

        <h2 class="cenit-h3 cenit-einblicke-h">Thanks — and what's next</h2>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">
          None of these steps would have been possible without the trust, support, and interest of many companions along the way.
          We would like to express our sincere thanks.
        </p>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body">
          2025 was a year of building. The coming years will be shaped by bringing these foundations to life, deepening partnerships, and embedding prevention
          where it is needed most. We look forward to continuing this journey together.
        </p>
        <p class="cenit-text-body cenit-einblicke-body" style="margin-bottom:0;">
          With kind regards<br><strong>The Management Board</strong><br>Dr. Christiane Theobald · Prof. Dr. Herbert Schuster · Manfred G. Schneider
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top:32px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
          <a href="/en/einblicke-entwicklungen/" style="font-size:13px; color:var(--muted-foreground); text-decoration:none;">← Back to overview</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
